			<item>
				<title>Install Digikam in Truenas Jail</title>
				<link>https://kowalcj0.github.io/2021/06/09/install-digikam-in-truenas-jail/</link>
				<pubDate>Wed, 09 Jun 2021 21:52:01 +0100</pubDate>
				<guid>https://kowalcj0.github.io/2021/06/09/install-digikam-in-truenas-jail/</guid>
				<description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;1---create-new-jail&#34;&gt;1 - Create new jail&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Use Web GUI or CLI to create a new jail according to your liking.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;I&amp;rsquo;m going to do it via Web GUI with &lt;code&gt;NAT&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;NAT Port Forwarding&lt;/code&gt; enabled.&lt;br&gt;&#xA;I&amp;rsquo;ll also add a port mapping for ssh from jail&amp;rsquo;s tcp port &lt;code&gt;22&lt;/code&gt; to host&amp;rsquo;s &lt;code&gt;22222&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;2---get-ports&#34;&gt;2 - Get ports&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Connect to the newly created jail so we can fetch and extract ports:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-shell&#34; data-lang=&#34;shell&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;iocage console digikam&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;portsnap fetch&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;portsnap extract&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id=&#34;3---install-dependencies&#34;&gt;3 - Install dependencies&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;At this point, it might be worth to install &lt;code&gt;xauth&lt;/code&gt; which will be required to start&#xA;&lt;code&gt;digikam&lt;/code&gt; via ssh with X11 Forwarding enabled and &lt;code&gt;vim&lt;/code&gt; to edit few config files.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>Install Photoprism in Truenas Jail</title>
				<link>https://kowalcj0.github.io/2021/06/05/install-photoprism-in-truenas-jail/</link>
