				<guid>https://kowalcj0.github.io/2021/06/05/install-photoprism-in-truenas-jail/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;For quite a while I&amp;rsquo;ve been looking for a self-hosted photo &amp;amp; video gallery.&lt;br&gt;&#xA;I tried things like:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://nextcloud.com&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34;&gt;NextCloud&lt;/a&gt; &lt;svg xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 12 16&#34; width=&#34;12&#34; height=&#34;16&#34;&gt;&lt;path fill-rule=&#34;evenodd&#34; d=&#34;M11 10h1v3c0 .55-.45 1-1 1H1c-.55 0-1-.45-1-1V3c0-.55.45-1 1-1h3v1H1v10h10v-3zM6 2l2.25 2.25L5 7.5 6.5 9l3.25-3.25L12 8V2H6z&#34;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://owncloud.com&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34;&gt;OwnCloud&lt;/a&gt; &lt;svg xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 12 16&#34; width=&#34;12&#34; height=&#34;16&#34;&gt;&lt;path fill-rule=&#34;evenodd&#34; d=&#34;M11 10h1v3c0 .55-.45 1-1 1H1c-.55 0-1-.45-1-1V3c0-.55.45-1 1-1h3v1H1v10h10v-3zM6 2l2.25 2.25L5 7.5 6.5 9l3.25-3.25L12 8V2H6z&#34;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://piwigo.org&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34;&gt;Piwigo&lt;/a&gt; &lt;svg xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 12 16&#34; width=&#34;12&#34; height=&#34;16&#34;&gt;&lt;path fill-rule=&#34;evenodd&#34; d=&#34;M11 10h1v3c0 .55-.45 1-1 1H1c-.55 0-1-.45-1-1V3c0-.55.45-1 1-1h3v1H1v10h10v-3zM6 2l2.25 2.25L5 7.5 6.5 9l3.25-3.25L12 8V2H6z&#34;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://lychee.electerious.com&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34;&gt;Lychee&lt;/a&gt; &lt;svg xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 12 16&#34; width=&#34;12&#34; height=&#34;16&#34;&gt;&lt;path fill-rule=&#34;evenodd&#34; d=&#34;M11 10h1v3c0 .55-.45 1-1 1H1c-.55 0-1-.45-1-1V3c0-.55.45-1 1-1h3v1H1v10h10v-3zM6 2l2.25 2.25L5 7.5 6.5 9l3.25-3.25L12 8V2H6z&#34;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Yet, none of them made the cut.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>Converting raw Nikon NEF files to DNG and back on Linux</title>
				<link>https://kowalcj0.github.io/2021/02/05/converting_raw_nikon_nef_files_to_dng_and_back_on_linux/</link>
				<pubDate>Fri, 05 Feb 2021 09:33:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>https://kowalcj0.github.io/2021/02/05/converting_raw_nikon_nef_files_to_dng_and_back_on_linux/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;Regardless of whether it makes sense or not to convert raw files to DNG, you&#xA;might choose a middleground solution and embed the original raw file in a DNG&#xA;file.&lt;br&gt;&#xA;The major drawback to this solution is that the resulting DNG file will&#xA;be roughly double in size when compared with the original raw file.&lt;br&gt;&#xA;The benefit of emdedding a raw files in a DNG file that you can easily extract&#xA;it later on.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
